  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large stone bowl over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the garlic and thyme and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the shrimp, mussels, and clams and cook until the seafood is opaque and the shells are open.",
    "Add the Dutch stroop and stir to combine.",
    "Add the fideua noodles and stir to combine.",
    "Cook for an additional 2 minutes or until the noodles are tender.",
    "Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "Serve immediately in the stone bowl."
